# Completion Review: enforce-egress-quota

## Fixed During Implementation

- Added `internal/egressquota` registry with daily/monthly counters, rpm, concurrency, request-log startup seed, and periodic reconcile.
- Wired `StoreCredentialProvider` to deny before credential lookup/injection when quota is exhausted.
- Wired MITM responses to return `429`, `X-Vault-Quota-Exhausted`, and `Retry-After`, while releasing concurrency slots and recording forwarded calls.
- Code Simplifier fix: reordered reserve checks so concurrency denial does not consume an rpm token.

## Verification

- `openspec validate enforce-egress-quota --strict`
- `go test ./internal/egressquota ./internal/brokercore ./internal/mitm ./internal/server ./cmd`
